      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense. I've already started looking at the purchase orders, but the discrepancies seem to pop up randomly—small amounts, like €15 or €20, just appearing under different vendors at odd times. It's almost like they are hiding in the cracks of the larger transactions. \n\nSince these aren't large enough to warrant a full investigation of the whole department, how can I isolate these specific \"odd\" entries more effectively? I need a way to filter out the noise so I can pinpoint exactly what's causing these little gaps.",
